OL,3,GNEWSAMore talks due in bid to break
OL,4,Abudget deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary will be
OL,7,Fin Northern Ireland later for further
OL,8,Ftalks with executive parties to try to
OL,9,Fbreak the budget deadlock.
OL,11,FSir Chris Bryant, who has insisted
OL,12,Fthere is no more money available beyond
OL,13,Fthe #1.5bn the government has already
OL,14,Foffered, has accused executive
OL,15,Fministers of being financially
OL,16,F"irresponsible".
OL,18,FHe held brief virtual discussions with
OL,19,Fparties last Friday, but it is
OL,20,Funderstood that Thursday's discussions
OL,21,Fwill involve a series of meetings
OL,22,Fbetween Sir Chris and party leaders.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
